      "content": "The concern isn't just a simple interaction but the potential for severe central nervous system depression when combining opioids and sedatives. Both medications can significantly slow down your breathing and mental functions, increasing the risk of overdose. Because these drugs affect your brain chemistry, dosing is very complex and risky without professional guidance. In a crisis, please contact an urgent care or an emergency line for immediate advice.",
