      "content": "i understand the breathing thing but i'm not talking about taking a bunch of them at once. i just mean like my normal dose of hydro followed by a single benadryl to knock me out. it doesn't seem like that's going to be an overdose level situation. if i just stick to the standard doses, is it actually dangerous or are you just being super cautious? i really need to sleep tonight.",
